#. module: sale_order_line_qty_policy_ddt
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:sale_order_line_qty_policy_ddt.field_stock_picking_package_preparation_line_force_invoiced
msgid "When set, this delivery note line is considered fully invoiced even if no invoice line was ever created from it; the line is no more selected to create an invoice from the delivery note.\n"
"It is the very same declaration of the sale order line, taken at delivery note level: use it when the goods of this line must not be billed, i.e. a free replacement."
msgstr ""

